\par\par \uc2 US news\par \b \uc2 Herschel Walker\uc2  accuser comes forward with fresh relationship claims\b0\par\par\uc2 Ed Pilkington in New York \par \uc2 592 \uc2 words\par \uc2 22 November 2022\par 22:30 GMT\par \uc2 The Guardian\par \uc2 GRDN\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2022.  The Guardian.  All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Woman who says she was pressured into \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  by Republican Senate hopeful presents unseen letters, audio and diary entries\par \par \uc2 The second woman to allege that she was pressured into having an \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  by \uc2 Herschel Walker\uc2 , the Republican nominee in Georgia\u8217\'20\'19s hotly contested {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2022/nov/15/raphael-warnock-sues-georgia-early-voting-restrictions"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 US Senate race}}}\uc2 , on Tuesday presented previously unseen letters, audio recordings and pages of her personal diary that she said were evidence of their relationship, which he has denied.\par \par \uc2 At a press conference in Los Angeles organized by her lawyer, Gloria Allred, the anonymous woman known only as Jane Doe came forward anew with a raft of fresh materials. She said she was doing so because when she {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wsbtv.com/news/local/second-woman-comes-forward-with-abortion-allegations-against-herschel-walker/EDHZXXLG3VEJPPNVJT7FNIC3H4/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 first aired her allegations}}}\uc2  last month \u8220\'20\'1Cand told the truth, he denied that he knew that I existed\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 The alleged new evidence of the relationship between the woman and the former college football star included a voicemail recording in which Walker was purported to say to her: \u8220\'20\'1CThis is your stud farm calling, you big sex puppy you\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 Jane Doe also read out a letter which she said had been written by Walker to her parents. \u8220\'20\'1CI do love your daughter and I\u8217\'20\'19m not out to hurt her. She has been a strong backbone for me through all of this,\u8221\'20\'1D the letter said.\par \par \uc2 The new allegations surfaced just as early voting is set to begin in the important {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2022/nov/15/raphael-warnock-sues-georgia-early-voting-restrictions"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 run-off election}}}\uc2  for a Georgia seat in the \uc2 US Senate\uc2  between Walker, who has publicly called for \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  to be banned, and the Democratic incumbent, Raphael Warnock, following a neck-and-neck result in the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/us-midterm-elections-2022"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 midterm elections}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Asked whether she was coming forward with a new round of allegations in order to influence the election, Jane Doe said: \u8220\'20\'1CVoters can make their own decision. All I can do is tell the truth.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 The unnamed woman initially raised her claims on 26 October that she was pressured into an \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 . She alleged that she had an intimate relationship with Walker for six years while he was playing for the \uc2 Dallas Cowboys\uc2  and that he paid for her to have an \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  in 1993, driving her to the clinic.\par \par \uc2 Walker rebutted the claims, saying: \u8220\'20\'1CI\u8217\'20\'19m done with this foolishness. I\u8217\'20\'19ve already told people this is a lie and I\u8217\'20\'19m not going to entertain it.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 At Tuesday\u8217\'20\'19s press conference, Jane Doe read passages of what she said were her personal diaries from 1993 in the days immediately after she learnt she was pregnant. In one extract Walker is alleged to have told her that the pregnancy was \u8220\'20\'1Cprobably his \u8216\'20\'18fault\u8217\'20\'19 since he had very high levels of testosterone\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 In a second passage, she wrote that Walker \u8220\'20\'1Chas about gone off the deep end over this whole thing \u8230\'20\'26 He thinks that by not having the baby we do have a future chance for happiness that we can \u8216\'20\'18grow strong again together.\u8217\'20\'19\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Allred read out what she said was a signed declaration from a friend of Jane Doe\u8217\'20\'19s in which she recalled her confiding to her in 1993 that she was pregnant and that Walker had been the partner. Several years later, the friend said in her declaration, \u8220\'20\'1Cshe confessed to me that she had in fact had an \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  in 1993\u8221\'20\'1D and that Walker had personally driven her to the clinic.\par \par \uc2 The first woman to make allegations against Walker told {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.thedailybeast.com/pro-life-herschel-walker-paid-for-girlfriends-abortion-georgia-senate"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 the Daily Beast}}}\uc2  last month that he paid for her to have an \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  in 2009.\par \par \uc2 Document GRDN000020221122eibm003xp\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw127\pich40\picscaley313\picscalex313\picwgoal610\pichgoal192
