\par\par \uc2 US news\par \b \uc2 Ohio\u8217\'20\'19s partisan supreme court election could decide  \highlight22\uc2 abortion \highlight\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s future in state\b0\par\par\uc2 Poppy Noor \par \uc2 788 \uc2 words\par \uc2 5 November 2022\par 08:01 GMT\par \uc2 The Guardian\par \uc2 GRDN\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2022.  The Guardian.  All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 The midterms include key elections to the state\u8217\'20\'19s highest court as the judicial system becomes increasingly politicized\par \par \uc2 In Ohio, a highly partisan fight over three state supreme court seats could determine the political direction of the court on a slew of important issues \u8211\'20\'13 particularly \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 With the \uc2 US supreme court\uc2  increasingly handing issues such as voting rights, \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 , gun rights and gerrymandering back to the states, state supreme court races are becoming more important than ever.\par \par \uc2 Few states illustrate how political these courts are becoming better than Ohio, where justices\u8217\'20\'19 party affiliation will be listed on the ballot for the first time in the 8 November election, and where the justices on that court will soon determine the fate of the state\u8217\'20\'19s six-week \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  ban that has been blocked and unblocked by lower courts since Roe v Wade was overturned early in the summer. \b \highlight22\uc2 Abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  is currently legal in the state up to 22 weeks, as the ban is being litigated.\par \par \uc2 As a result of the stakes, more {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.nytimes.com/2022/11/02/us/state-supreme-court-races-campaigns.html?referringSource=articleShare"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 cash}}}\uc2  is also pouring into state supreme court races around the country from political action committees associated with the national parties. Fair Courts America, a Pac associated with the Republican party, has {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.courier-journal.com/story/news/politics/2022/10/07/fair-courts-america-pac-spend-millions-key-kentucky-judicial-races/69546396007/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pledged $22.5m for state supreme court races}}}\uc2  this election cycle, to support conservative judicial candidates in Kentucky, Illinois, Louisiana, Michigan, North Carolina, Ohio and Texas.\par \par \uc2 In Kentucky, that same Pac has donated $1.6m to three conservative judges vying for election. One of those judges, Joe Fischer, is a former Republican congressman who was the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.courier-journal.com/story/news/politics/2022/10/07/fair-courts-america-pac-spend-millions-key-kentucky-judicial-races/69546396007/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 key sponsor of the state\u8217\'20\'19s trigger ban on \b  \highlight22abortion\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  that went into effect when Roe was overturned, as well as an {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2022/nov/01/us-midterms-abortion-initiatives-california-michigan-kentucky-vermont-montana"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 anti-\b  \highlight22abortion\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  referendum that\u8217\'20\'19s being put to Kentucky voters next week.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CPeople used to spend all their time looking at the federal constitution for protections, particularly when it came to individual rights. But now the \uc2 US supreme court\uc2  is basically saying these matters are better left resolved in the state courts and their state constitutions,\u8221\'20\'1D explains Bill Weisenberg, a former assistant executive director of the Ohio State Bar Association.\par \par \uc2 In Ohio, after Roe fell, ending the federal constitutional right to \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the state implemented a ban on \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  after six weeks of pregnancy. That ban is currently being blocked by a lower state court, but ultimately, it will land with the state supreme court. And the election of certain justices will be pivotal in determining the future of the ban.\par \par \uc2 The seven-justice Ohio supreme court currently has four Republican justices and three Democratic justices. The current chief justice, Maureen O\u8217\'20\'19Connor, a Republican, is not seeking re-election this year because of age limits, so two other sitting justices, Republican Sharon Kennedy and Democrat Jennifer Brunner, will battle it out to replace her in the top spot. Two incumbent Republican justices, Pat DeWine and Pat Fischer will face Democratic challengers Marilyn Zayas and Terri Jamison, for seats on the court.\par \par \uc2 O\u8217\'20\'19Connor, the chief justice who is standing down, was a Republican-affiliated judge who was happy to break with the party line on issues such as {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wvxu.org/politics/2022-02-08/commentary-blame-republicans-ohio-redistricting-map-chief-justice-maureen-oconnor"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 gerrymandering}}}\uc2 . She has never openly indicated where she stands on \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 But all three Republican justices up for election on Tuesday have stated on candidate surveys that they believe there is no constitutional right to \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 , according to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.news5cleveland.com/news/politics/ohio-politics/3-ohio-judicial-candidates-accused-of-breaking-ethics-code-told-political-group-abortion-isnt-constitutional-right"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 local news}}}\uc2 , meaning their elections could strike a fatal blow to \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  rights in Ohio.\par \par \uc2 They also came under fire in September for attending a Trump rally where the former president repeated baseless claims about the 2020 election being stolen, and for subsequently refusing to confirm that the results of the 2020 election {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.dispatch.com/restricted/?return=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.dispatch.com%2Fstory%2Fnews%2Fpolitics%2Felections%2F2022%2F09%2F22%2Fohio-supreme-court-justices-wont-say-if-2020-election-results-true%2F69507368007%2F"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 were valid}}}\uc2 . One of those justices \u8211\'20\'13 Pat DeWine \u8211\'20\'13 is also under scrutiny for having liked a tweet promoting a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://abc6onyourside.com/news/local/like-of-paul-pelosi-conspiracy-tweet-raises-questions-for-ohio-supreme-court-justice-pat-dewine"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 conspiracy theory}}}\uc2  about the violent attack on the husband of the House speaker, \uc2 Nancy Pelosi\uc2 , asking \u8220\'20\'1Cwhat are they hiding?\u8221\'20\'1D He has since said he clicked \u8220\'20\'1Clike\u8221\'20\'1D inadvertently.\par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, Zayas, Jamison and Brunner have publicly stated that they believe the Ohio constitution {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cosmopolitan.com/politics/a41531118/ohio-supreme-court-justice-race-abortion/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 protects the right to \b  \highlight22abortion\b0 \highlight22 .}}}\par \par \uc2 Weisenberg cautions that neither political affiliation, nor what a justice indicates of their views before their election, are watertight indicators for how they will rule once they are on the supreme court. \u8220\'20\'1CPeople are surprised sometimes when they read the opinion and it\u8217\'20\'19s not in keeping with where they thought the justice would lean, or what they had said on a prior occasion,\u8221\'20\'1D he said.\par \par \uc2 Indeed, the \uc2 US supreme court\uc2  justices \uc2 Brett Kavanaugh\uc2  and \uc2 Samuel Alito{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2022/jun/25/gorsuch-kavanaugh-misled-senators-roe-v-wade"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 indicated}}}\uc2  they believed the constitutional right to \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  was settled precedent before being confirmed to the court.\par \par \uc2 Document GRDN000020221105eib500105\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw127\pich40\picscaley313\picscalex313\picwgoal610\pichgoal192
