\par\par \uc2 Culture\par \b \uc2 Jimmy Kimmel: \u8216\'20\'18The only athlete dumb enough to sign with Donda Sports is \uc2 Herschel Walker\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19\b0\par\par\uc2 Guardian staff \par \uc2 853 \uc2 words\par \uc2 27 October 2022\par 14:50 GMT\par \uc2 The Guardian\par \uc2 GRDN\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2022.  The Guardian.  All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Late-night hosts discuss athletes leaving Kanye\u8217\'20\'19s West\u8217\'20\'19s sports agency and Dr Oz\u8217\'20\'19s much-derided comments on \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\par \par \uc2 Jimmy Kimmel\par \par \uc2 Jimmy Kimmel opened on Wednesday evening with the continued backlash to Kanye West\u8217\'20\'19s antisemitic statements, which have prompted the agency \uc2 CAA\uc2 , fashion house Balenciaga, and sportswear giant Adidas to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/music/2022/oct/25/adidas-cuts-ties-with-kanye-west-over-antisemitic-comments"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 sever business ties}}}\uc2  with him.\par \par \uc2 On Wednesday, West showed up unannounced and uninvited to the corporate headquarters at Skechers in Manhattan Beach, California. \u8220\'20\'1CIronically \u8211\'20\'13 this is not a joke \u8211\'20\'13 before he barged in to Skechers, he stopped at the bagel shop next door,\u8221\'20\'1D said Kimmel. \u8220\'20\'1CHe shouldn\u8217\'20\'19t be allowed to eat bagels any more, right? At least.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Several athletes, including \uc2 Los Angeles Rams\uc2  star Aaron Donald and \uc2 Boston Celtics\uc2  player Jaylen Brown, have {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.latimes.com/sports/rams/story/2022-10-25/rams-star-aaron-donald-among-those-cutting-ties-with-kayne-wests-donda-sports"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 cut ties with Donda Sports}}}\uc2 , a marketing and content agency owned by West.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CAt this point the only athlete who\u8217\'20\'19d be dumb enough to sign with Donda Sports is \uc2 Herschel Walker\uc2 ,\u8221\'20\'1D Kimmel quipped.\par \par \uc2 Things have not been going well for Walker, the Republican candidate for Senate in Georgia who has been running on a Trump-loyal, anti-\b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  platform. On Wednesday, a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2022/oct/26/herschel-walker-georgia-senate-abortion-clinic"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 second woman alleged}}}\uc2  that Walker paid for her \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  while they were in a relationship.\par \par \uc2 Walker has denied ever paying for an \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 , and doubled down at a campaign stop on Wednesday, telling reporters that he was \u8220\'20\'1Cdone with this foolishness\u8221\'20\'1D and \u8220\'20\'1Cdidn\u8217\'20\'19t kill JFK, either\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThat one is true, he did not kill JFK,\u8221\'20\'1D said Kimmel. \u8220\'20\'1CBut if he had killed him, he would\u8217\'20\'19ve done it while he was in the womb.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Stephen Colbert\par \par \uc2 On The Late Show, Stephen Colbert checked in on the close Senate race in Pennsylvania between lieutenant governor \uc2 John Fetterman\uc2  and celebrity TV doctor Mehmet Oz.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CDr Oz has had his problems running for Senate in Pennsylvania. For one thing, he lives in New Jersey,\u8221\'20\'1D Colbert explained. \u8220\'20\'1CAlso, he came out suuuuper anti-choice in the primary\u8221\'20\'1D and when asked about his stance on \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  in a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2022/oct/26/pennsylvania-senate-debate-mehmet-oz-john-fetterman"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 debate this week,}}}\uc2  \u8220\'20\'1Che accidentally said what he meant.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 As in, Oz said decisions about a woman\u8217\'20\'19s body should be between \u8220\'20\'1Cwomen, doctors and local political leaders\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CNo one should have to discuss healthcare with their local political leaders,\u8221\'20\'1D said Colbert. \u8220\'20\'1CEspecially if you live in one of those really small towns where the local mayor is a dog.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Asked about his continued support for Donald Trump amid numerous legal investigations, Oz said, \u8220\'20\'1CI haven\u8217\'20\'19t followed them very carefully \u8211\'20\'13 I\u8217\'20\'19ve been campaigning pretty aggressively \u8211\'20\'13 they\u8217\'20\'19ll work themselves out.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThey\u8217\'20\'19ll work themselves out?\u8221\'20\'1D Colbert exclaimed. \u8220\'20\'1CHe\u8217\'20\'19s a president being accused of treason, not a cat who swallowed some tinsel.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 He then turned to yet another scandal for \uc2 Herschel Walker\uc2  in Georgia as another woman claimed he paid for her \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  while they were having an affair. \u8220\'20\'1CWait a second \u8230\'20\'26 didn\u8217\'20\'19t we do this story already? Am I in a rerun right now?\u8221\'20\'1D Colbert wondered.\par \par \uc2 Trevor Noah\par \par \uc2 Did you see how Dr. Oz snuck in "local political leaders" like nobody would notice? {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/uaizgl0fmF"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pic.twitter.com/uaizgl0fmF}}}\uc2  \u8212\'20\'14 The Daily Show (@TheDailyShow) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/TheDailyShow/status/1585445050749579264?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 October 27, 2022}}}\par \par \uc2 And on the Daily Show, Trevor Noah zoned in on Dr Oz and his attempts to distance himself from Maga-verse to try to court centrist voters in Pennsylvania. \u8220\'20\'1CHe\u8217\'20\'19s basically doing that TikTok thing where you flip your hair down, and then when you come up you act like you suddenly didn\u8217\'20\'19t want to hang \uc2 Mike Pence\uc2 ,\u8221\'20\'1D Noah joked.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CBeing pro-Trump and pro-reasonable is a lot harder than people think,\u8221\'20\'1D he added. \u8220\'20\'1CWhich was apparent when Dr Oz had to explain his position on \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Asked if \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  should be banned in America, Oz demurred from answering directly and said \u8220\'20\'1Cthere should not be involvement from the federal government.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CI want women, doctors, local political leaders, letting the democracy that\u8217\'20\'19s always allowed our nation to thrive, to put the best ideas forward so states can decide for themselves,\u8221\'20\'1D Oz said.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThat\u8217\'20\'19s right, Dr Oz said \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  rights should be decided by women and their doctors and local political leaders,\u8221\'20\'1D Noah explained. \u8220\'20\'1CWhich was pretty slick, right? I like how he did it. Because he started that sentence like he was on the side of women, and then he snuck in the politicians at the end, like a teenager buying condoms at a gas station.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CIf you\u8217\'20\'19re pro-choice, what Dr Oz is suggesting is bullshit,\u8221\'20\'1D he added. \u8220\'20\'1CI think we can all agree: there is only one politician who should have a say in your \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 , and that\u8217\'20\'19s \uc2 Herschel Walker\uc2 , because it\u8217\'20\'19s his. It\u8217\'20\'19s probably his. Ladies, check \u8211\'20\'13 they\u8217\'20\'19re all his.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 2022-10-27T14:50:19Z 2022-10-27T14:57:33Z {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://media.guim.co.uk/5e8254e2b35c29358b25171517bda7a3bf53677a/188_127_2544_1526/500.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://media.guim.co.uk/5e8254e2b35c29358b25171517bda7a3bf53677a/188_127_2544_1526/500.jpg}}}\uc2  Jimmy Kimmel on athletes leaving Kanye West\u8217\'20\'19s sports agency: \u8216\'20\'18At this point the only athlete who\u8217\'20\'19d be dumb enough to sign with Donda Sports is \uc2 Herschel Walker\uc2 .\u8217\'20\'19\par \par \uc2 Document GRDN000020221027eiar002h2\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw127\pich40\picscaley313\picscalex313\picwgoal610\pichgoal192
