\par\par \uc2 US news\par \b \uc2 Second woman says \uc2 Herschel Walker\uc2  pressured her to have  \highlight22\uc2 abortion \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 Martin Pengelly and Maya Yang \par \uc2 750 \uc2 words\par \uc2 27 October 2022\par 01:59 GMT\par \uc2 The Guardian\par \uc2 GRDN\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2022.  The Guardian.  All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Lawyer Gloria Allred introduces woman as Jane Doe who alleges anti-\b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  candidate drove her to a clinic in the 1990s\par \par \uc2 Another woman has claimed that \uc2 Herschel Walker\uc2  pressured her into having an \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  and drove her to a clinic to obtain one.\par \par \uc2 On Wednesday, lawyer Gloria Allred \u8211\'20\'13 who has represented numerous alleged victims of sexual misconduct and assault \u8211\'20\'13 introduced to reporters a woman who alleges Walker, the anti-\b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  Republican candidate for Senate in Georgia, took her to an \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  clinic to have an \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the 1990s.\par \par \uc2 Allred said that her client, whom she introduced as Jane Doe, began dating the former football player in 1987 and had an intimate relationship with him for several years.\par \par \uc2 At the news conference, Allred presented evidence of hotel receipts, handwritten letters and a voice recording that Walker left Doe during their relationship.\par \par \uc2 In 1993, Doe found that she was pregnant, according to her attorney. When she told Walker, he \u8220\'20\'1Cclearly wanted her to have an \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 , and convinced her to do so. Our client alleges that Mr Walker gave her cash to pay for the \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 ,\u8221\'20\'1D said Allred.\par \par \uc2 In an emotional statement that Doe presented without revealing her face, she recalled how she felt \u8220\'20\'1Cconfused, uncertain and scared\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CI simply couldn\u8217\'20\'19t go through with it. I left the clinic in tears,\u8221\'20\'1D she said.\par \par \uc2 Doe then explained that Walker drove her again to the clinic and waited for her for hours until the \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  was complete.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CI was devastated because I felt that I had been pressured into having an \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 ,\u8221\'20\'1D Doe said, adding that she felt \u8220\'20\'1Cnaive\u8221\'20\'1D and that Walker \u8220\'20\'1Ctook advantage of me\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThe reason I am here today is because he has publicly taken the position that he is \u8216\'20\'18about life\u8217\'20\'19 and against \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  under any circumstances, when, in fact, he pressured me to have an \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  and personally ensured that it occurred by driving me to the clinic and paid for it,\u8221\'20\'1D she said.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CI do not believe that \uc2 Herschel Walker\uc2  is morally fit to be a US senator,\u8221\'20\'1D she said. \u8220\'20\'1CAnd that is the reason why I am speaking up and providing proof,\u8221\'20\'1D Doe said, adding that she was an independent and voted for Donald Trump twice.\par \par \uc2 The Guardian has not independently confirmed the account of Walker\u8217\'20\'19s latest accuser.\par \par \uc2 In response to the new reports, Walker {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/LaleeIbssa/status/1585348130593439744?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw%7Ctwcamp%5Etweetembed%7Ctwterm%5E1585348130593439744%7Ctwgr%5Eb44208137b83f57853c2ee87687eecc6d1034f73%7Ctwcon%5Es1_c10&ref_url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.theguardian.com%2Fus-news%2Flive%2F2022%2Foct%2F26%2Ffetterman-oz-debate-midterms-biden-politics-latest"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 said}}}\uc2  : \u8220\'20\'1CI\u8217\'20\'19m done with this foolishness. I\u8217\'20\'19ve already told people this is a lie and I\u8217\'20\'19m not going to entertain.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Walker has voiced strict anti-\b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  beliefs but has already been accused of paying for an \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  for another woman.\par \par \uc2 The Georgia Senate race is one of a group of contests that could be key to deciding control of the Senate in the midterm elections on 8 November.\par \par \uc2 The Democratic incumbent, \uc2 Raphael Warnock\uc2 , was elected in 2020, and along with \uc2 Jon Ossoff\uc2  gave Democrats the seats they needed to split the Senate 50-50, and control it via the vote of the vice-president, \uc2 Kamala Harris\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Warnock is a pastor at a church where the civil rights campaigner Martin Luther King once preached. Walker is a former college and \uc2 NFL\uc2  football star with a chequered business career who is endorsed by Donald Trump.\par \par \uc2 Nationwide, Democrats hope the supreme court ruling on {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2022/oct/26/pennsylvania-senate-debate-mehmet-oz-john-fetterman"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22abortion\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  will help motivate turnout as they seek to hold the House and Senate.\par \par \uc2 On Wednesday morning, before Allred\u8217\'20\'19s intervention, the polling website FiveThirtyEight gave Warnock {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://projects.fivethirtyeight.com/polls/senate/2022/georgia/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 a three-point lead}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 The other woman said Walker encouraged and paid for an \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  in 2009. Walker denied paying for the \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 , {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cbsnews.com/atlanta/news/herschel-walker-denies-paying-for-abortion-but-says-its-nothing-to-be-ashamed-if-ga/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 telling}}}\uc2  the conservative radio host \uc2 Hugh Hewitt\uc2 : \u8220\'20\'1CHad that happened, I would have said it, because it\u8217\'20\'19s nothing to be ashamed of there. You know, people have done that, but I know nothing about it. And if I knew about it, I would be honest and talk about it, but I know nothing about that.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 The same woman {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2022/oct/08/herschel-walker-urged-second-abortion-new-york-times"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 said}}}\uc2  he encouraged her to get a second \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  and had done \u8220\'20\'1Cnothing\u8221\'20\'1D for their son.\par \par \uc2 Walker {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2022/oct/15/us-midterm-elections-herschel-walker-abortion-ban-police-badge-georgia-senate-debate-warnock"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 has said}}}\uc2  he is in favour of a total \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  ban, in line with Republican policy in the aftermath of the \uc2 US supreme court\uc2  ruling which revoked the right to \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  in June.\par \par \uc2 On the debate stage earlier this month, Walker tried to deny being in favor of an outright \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  ban and attacked Warnock for being a Baptist pastor but supporting \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  rights.\par \par \uc2 Document GRDN000020221026eiaq002e6\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw127\pich40\picscaley313\picscalex313\picwgoal610\pichgoal192
