\par\par \uc2 US news\par \b \uc2 Florida governor debate: DeSantis defends  \highlight22\uc2 abortion \highlight\uc2  ban with false claims\b0\par\par\uc2 Martin Pengelly in New York \par \uc2 731 \uc2 words\par \uc2 25 October 2022\par 20:23 GMT\par \uc2 The Guardian\par \uc2 GRDN\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2022.  The Guardian.  All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Charlie Crist\uc2 , former Republican who switched parties, puts governor on defensive during Florida\u8217\'20\'19s sole gubernatorial debate\par \par \uc2 In the sole debate of the Florida governor\u8217\'20\'19s race, the Republican incumbent, \uc2 Ron DeSantis\uc2 , was put on the defensive by his Democratic challenger, \uc2 Charlie Crist\uc2 , on subjects including {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2022/oct/25/samuel-alito-ted-kennedy-roe-v-wade-abortion"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22abortion\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  and DeSantis\u8217\'20\'19s presidential ambitions.\par \par \uc2 Crist called Florida\u8217\'20\'19s 15-week \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  ban, which does not include exceptions for rape or incest, \u8220\'20\'1Ccallous and barbaric\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 DeSantis said he was proud of the ban but would not say if he supported further restrictions. He also made a string of false claims.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CI would like to see everybody have a shot,\u8221\'20\'1D DeSantis said. \u8220\'20\'1CI\u8217\'20\'19m proud of the 15 weeks that we did. I know \uc2 Charlie Crist\uc2  opposes that even though the baby is fully formed, has a heartbeat, can feel pain and can suck their thumb.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 A fetus can suck its thumb {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.mountsinai.org/health-library/special-topic/fetal-development#:~:text=A%20fetus%20at%2012%20weeks,sucking%20motions%20with%20the%20mouth."}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 at 12 weeks}}}\uc2  but is not fully formed at 15.\par \par \uc2 Regarding pain, the \uc2 American College of Obstetricians and Gynecologists{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.acog.org/advocacy/facts-are-important/gestational-development-capacity-for-pain"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 says}}}\uc2  : \u8220\'20\'1CThe science conclusively establishes that a human fetus does not have the capacity to experience pain until after at least 24\u8211\'20\'1325 weeks.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CEvery major medical organization that has examined this issue and peer-reviewed studies on the matter have consistently reached the conclusion that \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  before this point does not result in the perception of pain in a fetus.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 DeSantis also claimed Crist supported \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  \u8220\'20\'1Cuntil the moment of birth\u8221\'20\'1D, a procedure that does not exist, and \u8220\'20\'1Cdismemberment abortions\u8221\'20\'1D, which the \uc2 New York Times{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.nytimes.com/2022/10/24/us/politics/takeaways-desantis-crist-debate-florida.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 called}}}\uc2  \u8220\'20\'1Ca pejorative term for procedures performed later in pregnancy that, when they do happen, are often prompted by medical emergencies or severe fetal abnormalities\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 Democrats hope the supreme court\u8217\'20\'19s removal of the right to \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  will fuel success in November. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.pewresearch.org/fact-tank/2022/06/13/about-six-in-ten-americans-say-abortion-should-be-legal-in-all-or-most-cases-2/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 More than 60% of Americans}}}\uc2  say \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  should be legal and in elections this summer, the threat to \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  rights appeared to drive increased turnout among women and produce notable Democratic victories.\par \par \uc2 But with midterms election day now two weeks away, the signs are less promising for Democrats.\par \par \uc2 In Florida, Fivethirtyeight.com puts DeSantis {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://projects.fivethirtyeight.com/polls/governor/2022/florida/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 more than eight points up}}}\uc2 . Tuesday\u8217\'20\'19s debate was therefore something of a last chance for Crist, a former Republican governor who switched parties and now sits in the US House.\par \par \uc2 DeSantis is the strongest challenger to Donald Trump in polls regarding Republican presidential candidates in 2024. Crist tried to get him to commit to serving a second four-year term in Tallahassee if he wins the 8 November election. DeSantis would not bite.\par \par \uc2 What a moment that tells you where \uc2 Ron DeSantis\uc2 ' priorities are.\par \par \uc2 CRIST: Ron, will you serve a full 4-year term? Yes or no?\par \par \uc2 DESANTIS: *awkwardly stands there* {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/Hp6pwOFHfW"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pic.twitter.com/Hp6pwOFHfW}}}\uc2  \u8212\'20\'14 Ammar Moussa (@ammarmufasa) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/ammarmufasa/status/1584688835278970880?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 October 24, 2022}}}\par \par \uc2 Crist said: \u8220\'20\'1CWhy don\u8217\'20\'19t you look in the eyes of the people of the state of Florida and say to them if you\u8217\'20\'19re re-elected, you will serve a full four-year term as governor? Yes or no?\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 DeSantis did not respond.\par \par \uc2 Crist said: \u8220\'20\'1CIt\u8217\'20\'19s not a tough question. It\u8217\'20\'19s a fair question. He won\u8217\'20\'19t tell you.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Crist also hit DeSantis on his management of the response to Hurricane Ian; his culture wars-inspired attacks on businesses including \uc2 Walt Disney\uc2 ; the cost of living; and immigration, including a September stunt in which the governor used state funds to fly undocumented migrants to Massachusetts.\par \par \uc2 Crist called that flight to Martha\u8217\'20\'19s Vineyard, which has spawned lawsuits and investigations, \u8220\'20\'1Ca horrible political stunt\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 DeSantis said the flight \u8220\'20\'1Cput this issue front and center\u8221\'20\'1D and claimed: \u8220\'20\'1CWe have elites in this country who want to impose policies on\u8221\'20\'1D ordinary Americans.\par \par \uc2 The governor repeatedly linked Crist to \uc2 Joe Biden\uc2  \u8211\'20\'13 the president\u8217\'20\'19s approval ratings are low \u8211\'20\'13 as the two men sparred over who had done most to stoke political division.\par \par \uc2 DeSantis said: \u8220\'20\'1CThe day after \uc2 Charlie Crist\uc2  won his primary, he said anyone that supports the governor, you have hate in your heart and I don\u8217\'20\'19t want your vote. Well, think what that means.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Crist said: \u8220\'20\'1CYou love dividing our state, you know, whether it\u8217\'20\'19s Blacks against whites, whether it\u8217\'20\'19s gay against straight, whether it\u8217\'20\'19s young versus old. You\u8217\'20\'19re making it harder for people to vote.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Document GRDN000020221025eiap002e6\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw127\pich40\picscaley313\picscalex313\picwgoal610\pichgoal192
