\par\par \uc2 US news\par \b \uc2 Herschel Walker\uc2  denies  \highlight22\uc2 abortion \highlight\uc2  ban support and brandishes \u8216\'20\'18police badge\u8217\'20\'19 in Georgia debate\b0\par\par\uc2 Guardian staff and agencies \par \uc2 1,011 \uc2 words\par \uc2 17 October 2022\par 14:29 GMT\par \uc2 The Guardian\par \uc2 GRDN\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2022.  The Guardian.  All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Republican spars with Democratic senator \uc2 Raphael Warnock\uc2  in one-off contest in vital midterms race\par \par \uc2 The Republican Senate candidate \uc2 Herschel Walker\uc2 , a staunch anti-\b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  politician accused by a former girlfriend of encouraging and paying for her \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  in 2009, used his only debate against the Democratic senator \uc2 Raphael Warnock\uc2  on Friday to deny his previous support for an outright national \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  ban.\par \par \uc2 The former college football and \uc2 NFL\uc2  star, who is endorsed by \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2 , was asked about his support for \u8220\'20\'1Ca complete ban on a national level\u8221\'20\'1D. He said the moderator misstated his position. That contradicted statements made repeatedly on the campaign trail, including in July when Walker said it was \u8220\'20\'1Ca problem\u8221\'20\'1D that no national ban existed.\par \par \uc2 Walker also answered an attack from Warnock about his past claims about being a law enforcement officer by producing what he said was a police badge.\par \par \uc2 Warnock said: \u8220\'20\'1CYou can support police officers as I\u8217\'20\'19ve done \u8230\'20\'26 while at the same time holding police officers, like all professions, accountable. One thing I have not done, I\u8217\'20\'19ve never pretended to be a police officer. And I\u8217\'20\'19ve never, I\u8217\'20\'19ve never threatened a shootout with the police.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Saying \u8220\'20\'1CI have to respond to that\u8221\'20\'1D, Walker produced his badge.\par \par \uc2 Walker has never been a trained law enforcement officer, though he has law enforcement endorsements.\par \par \uc2 As Walker brandished his badge, the debate moderator said: \u8220\'20\'1CMr Walker, Mr Walker \u8211\'20\'13 excuse me, Mr Walker. I need to let you know, Mr Walker, you are very well aware of the rules tonight. And you have a prop that is not allowed. Sir, I asked you to put that prop away.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Walker did not do so immediately.\par \par \uc2 The moderator said: \u8220\'20\'1CExcuse me, sir. You\u8217\'20\'19re very well aware of the rules, aren\u8217\'20\'19t you?\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Walker said: \u8220\'20\'1CWell, let\u8217\'20\'19s talk about the truth.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Walker\u8217\'20\'19s apparent {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2022/oct/08/herschel-walker-urged-second-abortion-new-york-times"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 battle with the truth over \b  \highlight22abortion\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  has become a theme of the midterm elections. On Friday, he said his position was the same as Georgia\u8217\'20\'19s state law, a so-called heartbeat bill that bans \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  at six weeks, before many women know they are pregnant. That law went into effect this year after the \uc2 US supreme court\uc2  overturned the right to \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 The heated exchange on \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  was one of many that highlighted stark differences between Warnock and Walker. Warnock did not directly bring up the allegation about Walker {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2022/oct/08/herschel-walker-urged-second-abortion-new-york-times"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 paying for an \b  \highlight22abortion\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2 , leaving moderators to elicit a flat denial. Walker blasted Warnock for being a Baptist pastor who supports \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  rights.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CInstead of aborting those babies, why aren\u8217\'20\'19t you baptizing those babies?\u8221\'20\'1D he said.\par \par \uc2 Warnock said \u8220\'20\'1CGod gave us a choice and I respect the right of women to make a decision\u8221\'20\'1D, adding that Walker \u8220\'20\'1Cwants to arrogate more power to politicians than God has\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 Warnock and his fellow Democrat \uc2 Jon Ossoff\uc2  won their Senate seats in a January 2021 special election, two months after \uc2 Joe Biden\uc2  beat Trump in Georgia by fewer than 12,000 votes. It was the first time in two decades Democrats won federal elections in the state, raising questions about whether Warnock can win again as Biden\u8217\'20\'19s popularity falls.\par \par \uc2 In-person voting begins on Monday. The outcome will help determine control of the Senate, currently split 50-50.\par \par \uc2 Onstage, Walker claimed Warnock was a Biden puppet, saying the election was about what they \u8220\'20\'1Chad done to you and your family\u8221\'20\'1D in an inflationary economy. Warnock said the election was about \u8220\'20\'1Cwho is ready to represent Georgia\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 Walker blamed Warnock and Biden for inflation but offered little when asked what he would do to fix it. Walker said the first step was \u8220\'20\'1Cgetting back\u8221\'20\'1D to energy independence rather than depending \u8220\'20\'1Con our enemies\u8221\'20\'1D. The US had never been free from fossil fuel imports, some from countries such as Russia.\par \par \uc2 Warnock highlighted Biden\u8217\'20\'19s Inflation Reduction Act, focusing on provisions he sponsored capping insulin and other healthcare costs, the extension of the child tax credit and infrastructure provisions he shepherded with Republicans. He offered few specifics about further steps.\par \par \uc2 Warnock declined to say if Biden, nearing 80, should seek re-election in 2024. Walker deviated from Trump by saying Biden won legitimately in 2020. But he said he would support Trump if he ran in 2024. Both Walker and Warnock said they would accept the outcome of their election.\par \par \uc2 Both men discussed their personal lives. Recent reporting by the Daily Beast disclosed {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2022/oct/08/herschel-walker-urged-second-abortion-new-york-times"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 records of an \b  \highlight22abortion\b0 \highlight22  receipt and personal check}}}\uc2  from Walker to a woman who said he paid for her \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 . Walker\u8217\'20\'19s denials have continued even after the woman identified herself as the mother of one of his four children. Walker acknowledged three children publicly for the first time only after Beast reporting.\par \par \uc2 Other reports have detailed how Walker has exaggerated academic achievements, business success and philanthropic activities, as well as accusations he threatened the life of his ex-wife beyond details acknowledged in a 2008 memoir. In perhaps his most effective debate move, Warnock alluded to such stories.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CWe will see time and time again tonight, as we\u8217\'20\'19ve always seen, that my opponent has a problem with the truth,\u8221\'20\'1D said Warnock.\par \par \uc2 Dismissing reports that a foundation tied to Ebenezer Baptist Church, where he is senior pastor, had evicted tenants from real-estate holdings, Warnock said Walker was trying to \u8220\'20\'1Csully the name of Martin Luther King\u8217\'20\'19s church\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 Walker pointed to his memoir, in which he detailed a diagnosis of dissociative personality disorder. Walker said he had \u8220\'20\'1Cbeen transparent\u8221\'20\'1D and \u8220\'20\'1Ccontinue[d] to get help if I need help, but I don\u8217\'20\'19t need any help. I\u8217\'20\'19m doing well. I\u8217\'20\'19m ready to lead today.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Walker declined three debates typical in Georgia campaigns. The Savannah debate did not include the libertarian Chase Oliver, who did not meet a polling threshold. Warnock will meet Oliver in a Sunday debate sponsored by the Atlanta Press Club. Walker will be represented by an empty podium.\par \par \uc2 Document GRDN000020221017eiah0012y\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw127\pich40\picscaley313\picscalex313\picwgoal610\pichgoal192
