\par\par \uc2 US news\par \b \uc2 Can Democrats win tight midterm races with a pro-choice message? Pat Ryan says yes\b0\par\par\uc2 Poppy Noor \par \uc2 1,114 \uc2 words\par \uc2 12 October 2022\par 13:11 GMT\par \uc2 The Guardian\par \uc2 GRDN\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2022.  The Guardian.  All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 The congressman won a swing upstate New York district with a progressive platform \u8211\'20\'13 and says Democrats can use his playbook\par \par \uc2 When Democrat Pat Ryan got elected to New York\u8217\'20\'19s 19th \u8211\'20\'13 a largely rural district in upstate New York that swung for Trump in 2016 and only narrowly elected Biden in 2020 \u8211\'20\'13 people were surprised.\par \par \uc2 His contender in the August special election, Marc Molinaro, was a well-known local politician who entered the political arena when he was just 18, becoming the mayor of Tivoli, which is in the district, at 19. Molinaro was the favorite to win: leading in the polls, by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cityandstateny.com/politics/2022/08/new-poll-shows-statistical-tie-between-pat-ryan-and-marc-molinaro-ny-19-special-election/376049/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 as much as 10 points}}}\uc2 , right up to the moment Ryan claimed victory.\par \par \uc2 The special election was watched with bated breath, as a tight race in a swing seat that could be a harbinger in the midterm elections, where Democrats are fighting to keep a slim House majority come November. Now, people are looking at Ryan\u8217\'20\'19s campaign as a political playbook for how to win other tight races across the country.\par \par \uc2 Many credit Ryan\u8217\'20\'19s win to seizing the political moment around the fierce fight for \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  rights in the US.\par \par \uc2 Just hours after the constitutional right to \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  was dismantled by the \uc2 US supreme court\uc2  on 24 June, Ryan, a US army vet, released a campaign ad making his stance clear. In a surprising twist, the video tied his military service to the attack on \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CHow can we be a free country if the government tries to control women\u8217\'20\'19s bodies? That\u8217\'20\'19s not the country I fought to defend,\u8221\'20\'1D he said in the ad.\par \par \uc2 It was a much-needed balm at a time when the Democratic party was being criticized at the national level for lacking a sense of urgency in responding to the fall of Roe v Wade, the landmark decision that had protected \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  rights in the US for several generations.\par \par \uc2 How can we be a free country if the government tries to control women\u8217\'20\'19s bodies?\par \par \uc2 Pat Ryan\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CI think what is missing in our politics right now is just speaking from the heart, rather than poll testing,\u8221\'20\'1D Ryan told the Guardian when asked why he thought that message on \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  resonated.\par \par \uc2 Then, a few months into Ryan\u8217\'20\'19s campaign, the Republican senator \uc2 Lindsey Graham\uc2  introduced a bill that would ban \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  at the national level, after 15 weeks. The bill never would have had enough support to pass, but it didn\u8217\'20\'19t matter: after months of the Republicans saying \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  rights should be put to the states, Graham appeared to have revealed his party\u8217\'20\'19s hand in pushing for a national crackdown.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThey showed themselves to be extremists. Suddenly, we saw the new Republican platform was wanting to criminalize abortions at the national level,\u8221\'20\'1D said Ryan.\par \par \uc2 His special election win gives him just a few months representing New York\u8217\'20\'19s 19th before he has to run again in the midterms. And the \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  message is one he continues to campaign on.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThere was just another set of horrific reporting out of Ohio, where at least two teenage women under the age of 18 were raped and forced to fly to other states, just to get reproductive health care. That\u8217\'20\'19s just as barbaric. And that\u8217\'20\'19s not who we are as a country,\u8221\'20\'1D he said.\par \par \uc2 Adding that he thinks the Democrats will hold the house and the Senate, he continued: \u8220\'20\'1CWe absolutely have to restore those decisions back to women, and away from politicians, frankly.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Ryan just introduced a bill to make \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  medication legal at the national level. If it passes, it will undermine states\u8217\'20\'19 attempts to ban \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 , considering that more than half of US abortions are completed using medication.\par \par \uc2 His pledge is again a foil to the national party\u8217\'20\'19s mostly lackluster attempts to curtail the destruction of \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  rights across the US, with \uc2 Joe Biden\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s own \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  bill coming {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2022/aug/03/biden-executive-order-protect-abortion-access"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 under fire}}}\uc2  precisely because it failed to make it easier for Americans to access \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  pills.\par \par \uc2 It may seem strange that a candidate like Ryan \u8211\'20\'13 who wants to pass gun control laws, raise taxes on the wealthy and make \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  pills nationally accessible \u8211\'20\'13 would win in a district that elected Trump.\par \par \uc2 But it\u8217\'20\'19s the way he ties together seemingly progressive ideals under the banner of freedom thats seems to resonate. He talks about seeing voters in his own district on the campaign trail. Whether in some of the most rural and conservative parts of his district, at events with small business owners, or speaking to younger people, he says \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  rights came up over and over.\par \par \uc2 So to him, the playbook is simple.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CAll we have to do is show Americans that we understand how existential this fight is. The fight for reproductive freedom; for voting rights; the fight against gun violence; the fight for our democracy. We need to draw attention to how un-American it is to take away these freedoms,\u8221\'20\'1D said Ryan.\par \par \uc2 We showed that we can take so-called \u8216\'20\'18wedge issues\u8217\'20\'19 and remind people that we actually share these values in common\par \par \uc2 Pat Ryan\par \par \uc2 Does he feel it is contradictory, to stand for the rights of American women, or children at threat of being gunned down in American schools, when he participated in a war and occupation that led to the deaths of tens of thousands of Iraqi civilians?\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CI have said publicly that the decision to go to war in Iraq and the way we conducted it \u8211\'20\'13 there\u8217\'20\'19s an awful lot we should have done better,\u8221\'20\'1D he said.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CI personally had to wrestle with seeing my fellow soldiers and innocent civilians \u8211\'20\'13 whom I had built relationships with \u8211\'20\'13 put at risk. Seeing war very close and personally, you see the darkest and the most evil in human nature come forward. We need people in Congress who understand the seriousness of sending our young men and women into combat. War has to be our absolute last resort,\u8221\'20\'1D he said.\par \par \uc2 And with this call for unity he hopes he can win in November.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CWe\u8217\'20\'19re so divided. And for a long time politicians have pitted people against each other, but we showed in the special election that we can take so-called \u8216\'20\'18wedge issues\u8217\'20\'19 and remind people that we actually share these values in common \u8211\'20\'13 things like reproductive freedom. This is a moment where we have to be clear-eyed about the stakes,\u8221\'20\'1D he says.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CAuthenticity, and just being a normal human being \u8211\'20\'13 that is something that is in short supply right now in our politics.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Document GRDN000020221012eiac0020e\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw127\pich40\picscaley313\picscalex313\picwgoal610\pichgoal192
