\par\par \uc2 US news\par \b \uc2 Woman tells \uc2 New York Times\uc2  that \uc2 Herschel Walker\uc2  urged her to have second  \highlight22\uc2 abortion \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 Edward Helmore \par \uc2 829 \uc2 words\par \uc2 10 October 2022\par 13:07 GMT\par \uc2 The Guardian\par \uc2 GRDN\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2022.  The Guardian.  All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 The Republican candidate for a Georgia US Senate seat has insisted that he does not know the woman\u8217\'20\'19s identity\par \par \uc2 Herschel Walker\uc2 , the Republican candidate for a Georgia US Senate seat, has maintained he does not know the identity of a woman who claims that in 2009 she terminated a pregnancy that was the result of her and Walker\u8217\'20\'19s relationship.\par \par \uc2 But on Friday, the woman at the center of a political storm that threatens to undo the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=g80r5KDQCLM"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 former Dallas Cowboys running back\u8217\'20\'19s}}}\uc2  campaign told the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.nytimes.com/2022/10/07/us/politics/herschel-walker-abortion.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 New York Times }}}\uc2  that Walker urged her to terminate a second pregnancy two years later and that their relationship ended when she declined.\par \par \uc2 The woman, a former girlfriend whom Walker has referred to as \u8220\'20\'1Csome alleged woman\u8221\'20\'1D, said the Senate hopeful backed by former president \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2  had scarcely been involved in their son\u8217\'20\'19s life other than child support and gifts.\par \par \uc2 But she offered a perspective on a candidate who has appealed to the state\u8217\'20\'19s social conservatives as an opponent of \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  \u8211\'20\'13 even in cases of rape and incest.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CAs a father, he\u8217\'20\'19s done nothing,\u8221\'20\'1D she told the Times, insisting on anonymity to protect her son. \u8220\'20\'1CHe does exactly what the courts say, and that\u8217\'20\'19s it.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CHe has to be held responsible, just like the rest of us. And if you\u8217\'20\'19re going to run for office, you need to own your life.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 She provided the paper with a $575 receipt from an Atlanta women\u8217\'20\'19s clinic where the 2009 procedure was performed, as well as a check deposit slip showing a copy of a $700 check she claims Walker gave her as reimbursement.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThe first I knew about any of this was when some reporter asked me about an \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 . And I\u8217\'20\'19m like, \u8216\'20\'18No, that\u8217\'20\'19s a lie.\u8217\'20\'19 And then I was asked if I paid for an \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 , and I said no. I did not pay for an \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 ,\u8221\'20\'1D Walker {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.nbcnews.com/politics/2022-election/texts-show-family-strife-herschel-walkers-wife-woman-alleged-paid-abor-rcna51279"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 told NBC News on Friday.}}}\uc2  \u8220\'20\'1CI\u8217\'20\'19m not saying she did or didn\u8217\'20\'19t have one [an \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 ]. I\u8217\'20\'19m saying I don\u8217\'20\'19t know anything about that. I don\u8217\'20\'19t know.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Walker\u8217\'20\'19s wife, Julie Blanchard, disclosed to the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.thedailybeast.com/herschel-walkers-wife-reaches-out-to-his-abortion-accuser-georgia-senate"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Daily Beast}}}\uc2  on Friday that she had been in touch with the woman who had told her it was \u8220\'20\'1Ccruel\u8221\'20\'1D that Walker \u8220\'20\'1Ccontinues to claim he doesn\u8217\'20\'19t know me or the \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  he paid for\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CHe brought all of this on himself when he decided to get on a platform and denounce \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  and make a mockery of his children who have done NOTHING to deserve this,\u8221\'20\'1D the anonymous woman reportedly also said.\par \par \uc2 Blanchard said that \u8220\'20\'1Cthis makes me incredibly sad\u8221\'20\'1D, adding that she \u8220\'20\'1Cwitnessed everyday Herschel pray for you and [your son] & everyone in our family\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 She told the outlet that Walker calls and texts the 10-year-old child \u8220\'20\'1Cregularly\u8221\'20\'1D and feels \u8220\'20\'1Csadness\u8221\'20\'1D when he gets no response \u8211\'20\'13 to which the woman replied, \u8220\'20\'1CAre you kidding me?\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 The woman has said that Walker has never missed any of his $3,500 monthly child-support payments, but the complex drama has nonetheless focused attention on the Republican candidate that his campaign did not want.\par \par \uc2 Besides his opposition to \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 , he has four children with four different women after openly criticizing absentee dads in the Black community.\par \par \uc2 Walker has disputed that he does not acknowledge his children. \u8220\'20\'1CI just chose not to use them as props to win a political campaign,\u8221\'20\'1D he said in June. \u8220\'20\'1CWhat parent would want their child involved in garbage, gutter politics like this?\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 But some criticism has come from close to home. \u8220\'20\'1CYou\u8217\'20\'19re not a \u8216\'20\'18family man\u8217\'20\'19 when you left us to bang a bunch of women, threatened to kill us, and had us move over 6 times in 6 months running from your violence,\u8221\'20\'1D Walker\u8217\'20\'19s adult son and conservative social-media influencer Christian Walker said {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/ChristianWalk1r/status/1577104266543497216?s=20&t=BhsyPlvaS3dWOwRnPjh_sg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 on Twitter}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Herschel Walker\uc2  responded with {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/HerschelWalker/status/1577115984452030464?s=20&t=BhsyPlvaS3dWOwRnPjh_sg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 his own tweet}}}\uc2  : \u8220\'20\'1CI LOVE my son no matter what.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 But the revelations have challenged Walker\u8217\'20\'19s conservative political positions as he faces off with Democratic incumbent Raphael Warnock for the \uc2 US Senate\uc2  seat that could determine control of the evenly divided legislative body.\par \par \uc2 A Fox News poll conducted after reports emerged last week that Walker {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.thedailybeast.com/pro-life-herschel-walker-paid-for-girlfriends-abortion-georgia-senate"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 had paid for }}}\uc2  the former girlfriend to have an \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  showed Warnock at 47% and Walker at 44%.\par \par \uc2 Warnock\u8217\'20\'19s campaign recently {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.ajc.com/politics/georgia-candidates-set-money-records-ahead-of-november-election/Y7L5NXBFKFCO3EHYSWPZ5TI3U4/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 reported}}}\uc2  having $13.7m in cash on hand.\par \par \uc2 Walker\u8217\'20\'19s campaign said it has more than $7m. Walker\u8217\'20\'19s campaign manager, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/swparadise/status/1577379504510668806"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Scott Paradise}}}\uc2 , said the candidate had his best fundraising days immediately after the \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  revelation, contained in a Daily Beast article on 3 October.\par \par \uc2 Nonetheless, there has apparently been an atmosphere of chaos in the Walker campaign since the bombshell Daily Beast report. Two days after the report, the campaign cut ties with its political director, Taylor Crowe, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cnn.com/2022/10/07/politics/herschel-walker-taylor-crowe-georgia-senate/index.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 CNN reported}}}\uc2 , citing multiple sources.\par \par \uc2 Document GRDN000020221008eia800209\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw127\pich40\picscaley313\picscalex313\picwgoal610\pichgoal192
