\par\par \uc2 Culture\par \b \uc2 Kimmel on Biden\u8217\'20\'19s marijuana pardon: \u8216\'20\'18Glad Willie Nelson is alive to see this\u8217\'20\'19\b0\par\par\uc2 Guardian staff \par \uc2 963 \uc2 words\par \uc2 7 October 2022\par 14:54 GMT\par \uc2 The Guardian\par \uc2 GRDN\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2022.  The Guardian.  All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Late-night hosts discuss Biden\u8217\'20\'19s pardon for federal marijuana possession offenses and \uc2 Herschel Walker\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s hypocrisy\par \par \uc2 Jimmy Kimmel\par \par \uc2 On Thursday, Jimmy Kimmel celebrated \uc2 Joe Biden\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s decision to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2022/oct/07/first-thing-biden-pardons-thousands-convicted-for-marijuana-possession"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pardon all prior federal offenses for simple marijuana possession}}}\uc2 , which affects more than 6,000 Americans. \u8220\'20\'1CThe move stops short of full decriminalization, which will probably have to wait until we have a President Woodrow Harrelson or something,\u8221\'20\'1D Kimmel joked.\par \par \uc2 But \u8220\'20\'1Cit is the most cannabis-friendly decision by a US president yet,\u8221\'20\'1D he continued. \u8220\'20\'1CAnd I for one am just glad Willie Nelson is alive to see this happen.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Kimmel also mocked the Georgia Senate candidate, \uc2 Herschel Walker\uc2 , an anti-\b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  Republican who this week was revealed to have {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.thedailybeast.com/pro-life-herschel-walker-paid-for-girlfriends-abortion-georgia-senate"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 paid for his then-girlfriend\u8217\'20\'19s \b  \highlight22abortion\b0 \highlight22  in 2009}}}\uc2 . The woman also said she had a child with Walker, who has been less than forthcoming on the campaign trail about his number of offspring.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CIn fairness to Herschel, he\u8217\'20\'19s got a lot of mothers with a lot of children, so he\u8217\'20\'19s supposed to remember all of them?\u8221\'20\'1D Kimmel quipped. \u8220\'20\'1CAt this point, \uc2 Herschel Walker\uc2  has misrepresented so much of his life, they should give him the Lies-man Trophy.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 After the bombshell report of Walker\u8217\'20\'19s private \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  stance, \u8220\'20\'1CRepublicans are scrambling trying to figure out how to handle this,\u8221\'20\'1D said Kimmel. \u8220\'20\'1CShould they continue to back him for Senate? Or do they ask him to drop out so he can run for president in two years?\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Trevor Noah\par \par \uc2 Biden just pardoned those convicted on federal weed possession. Are we sure he's not a huge pothead? {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/yrMXaFblPW"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pic.twitter.com/yrMXaFblPW}}}\uc2  \u8212\'20\'14 The Daily Show (@TheDailyShow) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/TheDailyShow/status/1578203875357736960?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 October 7, 2022}}}\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThis is something that should\u8217\'20\'19ve been done a long time ago,\u8221\'20\'1D said Trevor Noah of Biden\u8217\'20\'19s pardon of federal marijuana offenses. \u8220\'20\'1CCan you imagine getting pardoned for this after seeing how mainstream weed has become in America? I bet witches probably feel the same way, you know \u8211\'20\'13 \u8216\'20\'18Oh, so these hipster chicks can walk around Brooklyn with their candles, but when I do the same, I got burned!\u8217\'20\'19\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 In all seriousness, \u8220\'20\'1Cthis is really good for America,\u8221\'20\'1D the Daily Show host said.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CI know everybody is saying that \uc2 Joe Biden\uc2  is just doing this to boost his popularity before the midterms,\u8221\'20\'1D he added. \u8220\'20\'1CBut in my opinion, I think maybe this thing hits closer to home. I wouldn\u8217\'20\'19t be surprised if \uc2 Joe Biden\uc2  was secretly a huge pothead.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThink about it: \uc2 Joe Biden\uc2  could smoke a lot of weed,\u8221\'20\'1D he noted. \u8220\'20\'1CHe\u8217\'20\'19s always puttering around like he forgot where he\u8217\'20\'19s going, he\u8217\'20\'19s wearing sunglasses everywhere he goes. I mean, he definitely talks like he\u8217\'20\'19s high.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Stephen Colbert\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThat sneaky \uc2 Joe Biden\uc2  pulled an October surprise on the Republicans by doing something popular,\u8221\'20\'1D said Stephen Colbert of the marijuana pardon. \u8220\'20\'1CToday, Dark Brandon became Dank Brandon.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Colbert also tore into news that the woman who says \uc2 Herschel Walker\uc2  paid for her \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  in 2009 also had a child with him. \u8220\'20\'1CCome on, man! How many secret kids does this guy have? Does he know he doesn\u8217\'20\'19t get a free smoothie after 10?\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Asked by campaign reporters if he had reached out to any of the mothers of his children, Walker answered: \u8220\'20\'1CNo \u8230\'20\'26 why do I need to?\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CMaybe to find out how your children are doing?\u8221\'20\'1D Colbert responded. \u8220\'20\'1CRemember? The ones you don\u8217\'20\'19t remember? Plus, there\u8217\'20\'19s so many of them, statistically it\u8217\'20\'19s probably one of their birthdays.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Seth Meyers\par \par \uc2 And on Late Night, Seth Meyers looked at the state of the midterm races with less than a month to go until the election. Republicans have nominated many pro-Trump election deniers, \u8220\'20\'1Cand while the opposition party historically is always heavily favored to perform well in off-year elections, Republicans are stumbling toward the finish line after several of their pro-Trump Maga candidates have just fully imploded,\u8221\'20\'1D he said.\par \par \uc2 One Ohio GOP candidate {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://apnews.com/article/2022-midterm-elections-afghanistan-ohio-campaigns-e75d2566635f11f49332bd1c46711999"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 lied about his military service}}}\uc2 , the Pennsylvania Senate candidate Dr Mehmet Oz {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2022/oct/04/dr-oz-dogs-us-senate-pennsylvania-john-fetterman"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 has been accused of killing over 300 dogs}}}\uc2  in his scientific experiments, and then there\u8217\'20\'19s \uc2 Herschel Walker\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s hypocrisy over \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  in Georgia.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThe craziest thing is: the GOP just never runs out of ways to shock you,\u8221\'20\'1D Meyers said. \u8220\'20\'1CThe Democrats no doubt have their flaws, but the GOP is like a magnet for all these pathological liars with incredibly sordid pasts.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CI can\u8217\'20\'19t even begin to imagine who Trump is going to endorse next,\u8221\'20\'1D he continued, especially given new details on Trump in {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/books/2022/oct/02/confidence-man-review-maggie-haberman-donald-trump"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Confidence Man}}}\uc2 , a 600-plus-page tell-all by the \uc2 New York Times\uc2  reporter Maggie Haberman released this week.\par \par \uc2 In an appearance on cable news, Haberman said Trump \u8220\'20\'1Cbelieves that everyone is just like him. Everything is transaction, everything can be exchanged, everything can be reduced to a deal. There are no red lines. And so to show that there are no red lines always makes him happy.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CI honestly didn\u8217\'20\'19t think there was anything that made Trump happy, but now we know there is one thing: making the rest of us miserable,\u8221\'20\'1D said Meyers. \u8220\'20\'1CLike his mood will never change, but if he brings our moods down enough, his sour existence will count as happy and then, I don\u8217\'20\'19t know, he\u8217\'20\'19ll get a morning show where they spell his name with an exclamation point?\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 2022-10-07T14:54:32Z 2022-10-10T16:34:57Z {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://media.guim.co.uk/1626a0ce72ad25ac88f791831adedb37dcb1c800/176_118_2538_1523/500.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://media.guim.co.uk/1626a0ce72ad25ac88f791831adedb37dcb1c800/176_118_2538_1523/500.jpg}}}\uc2  Jimmy Kimmel: \u8216\'20\'18The move stops short of full decriminalization, which will probably have to wait until we have a President Woodrow Harrelson or something.\u8217\'20\'19\par \par \uc2 Document GRDN000020221007eia700236\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw127\pich40\picscaley313\picscalex313\picwgoal610\pichgoal192
