\par\par \uc2 US news\par \b \uc2 Republicans throw support behind \uc2 Herschel Walker\uc2  after  \highlight22\uc2 abortion \highlight\uc2  denial\b0\par\par\uc2 Maya Yang \par \uc2 975 \uc2 words\par \uc2 7 October 2022\par 16:10 GMT\par \uc2 The Guardian\par \uc2 GRDN\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2022.  The Guardian.  All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 The Georgia senate candidate has garnered support from \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2  to \uc2 Lindsey Graham\par \par \uc2 Republicans and anti-\b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  groups across the country have been flocking to \uc2 Herschel Walker\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s defense despite accusations that the Republican candidate for Georgia\u8217\'20\'19s senate paid for a woman\u8217\'20\'19s \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  in 2009.\par \par \uc2 After the accusation from an alleged ex-girlfriend was first {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.thedailybeast.com/pro-life-herschel-walker-paid-for-girlfriends-abortion-georgia-senate?ref=home"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 reported}}}\uc2  in the Daily Beast, some of the country\u8217\'20\'19s most influential Republicans have been either echoing Walker\u8217\'20\'19s denial of the \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  or remaining in deafening silence, in turn revealing a clear hypocrisy towards the issue of \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  rights.\par \par \uc2 Walker, ostensibly a staunch anti-\b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  candidate, is currently in a tight race against the state\u8217\'20\'19s Democratic senator Raphael Warnock in hopes of winning a Senate seat in less than five weeks and reclaiming control of the chamber. As part of his campaign, Walker has stated that he wants a total ban on abortions, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.nytimes.com/2022/05/19/us/politics/herschel-walker-abortion-ban.html?smid=nytcore-ios-share&referringSource=articleShare"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2  saying}}}\uc2  \u8220\'20\'1Cthere\u8217\'20\'19s no exception in my mind \u8230\'20\'26 Like I say, I believe in life. I believe in life.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 On Monday, a bombshell report emerged that a woman who asked not to be identified underwent an \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  that Walker paid for after the former couple discovered that they had conceived a child.\par \par \uc2 In response, Walker denied paying for the \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 , {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cbsnews.com/atlanta/news/herschel-walker-denies-paying-for-abortion-but-says-its-nothing-to-be-ashamed-if-ga/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 telling}}}\uc2  the conservative radio host \uc2 Hugh Hewitt\uc2 , \u8220\'20\'1CHad that happened, I would have said it, because it\u8217\'20\'19s nothing to be ashamed of there. You know, people have done that, but I know nothing about it. And if I knew about it, I would be honest and talk about it, but I know nothing about that.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 He has since doubled down on his denial, accusing Democrats of sabotaging his campaign. \u8220\'20\'1CI know why you\u8217\'20\'19re here,\u8221\'20\'1D he {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.fox19.com/2022/10/06/herschel-walker-sticks-abortion-claim-denial-pivots-blame-dems/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 told}}}\uc2  reporters this week after his first campaign address since the reports emerged. \u8220\'20\'1CYou\u8217\'20\'19re here because the Democrats are desperate to hold on to this seat here, and they\u8217\'20\'19re desperate to make this race about my family.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Republicans have been echoing Walker\u8217\'20\'19s defense, with many claiming the story is a fraudulent attack launched by Democrats. Others have gone as far as to express no interest in the truth of the allegation as they reaffirm the priority of regaining control.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CWhat I\u8217\'20\'19m about to say is in no means a contradiction or a compromise of a principle. And please keep in mind that I am concerned about one thing, and one thing only at this point. I don\u8217\'20\'19t care if \uc2 Herschel Walker\uc2  paid to abort endangered baby eagles. I want control of the Senate,\u8221\'20\'1D {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/patriottakes/status/1577442950044426240?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw%7Ctwcamp%5Etweetembed%7Ctwterm%5E1577442950044426240%7Ctwgr%5Ec20956bbb38cc34384c9f0d993cc98f85586964a%7Ctwcon%5Es1_c10&ref_url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.newsweek.com%2Fdana-loesch-doesnt-care-herschel-walker-paid-skank-abortion-1749023"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 said}}}\uc2 Dana Loesch\uc2 , a conservative radio host and former spokesperson of the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.newsweek.com/topic/national-rifle-association"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 National Rifle Association}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Florida\u8217\'20\'19s Republican senator \uc2 Rick Scott\uc2  accused Democrats of launching a smear campaign. Scott, who previously {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.rickscott.senate.gov/2022/6/sen-rick-scott-scotus-is-right-to-protect-life-respect-federalism-reverse-roe"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 said}}}\uc2  that \u8220\'20\'1C\b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  ends a life. It is abhorrent and has no place in our society,\u8221\'20\'1D defended Walker earlier this week in a public {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/sahilkapur/status/1577325123337592832?s=20&t=XDtiTHEvJGqHjbgxh_IYQA"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 statement.}}}\par \par \uc2 As the chairman of the National Republican Senatorial Committee, Scott wrote, \u8220\'20\'1CWhen the Democrats are losing, as they are right now, they lie and cheat and smear their opponents \u8230\'20\'26 They know that \uc2 Herschel Walker\uc2  is winning, so they have cranked up the smear machine.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Former president \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2 , who once {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.politico.com/story/2019/05/19/donald-trump-abortion-twitter-1332803"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 called}}}\uc2  himself \u8220\'20\'1Cstrongly pro-life\u8221\'20\'1D and said that women who get abortions should {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.businessinsider.com/trump-2016-video-women-who-get-abortions-should-face-punishment-2022-5"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 face}}}\uc2  \u8220\'20\'1Csome form of punishment\u8221\'20\'1D, also came to Walker\u8217\'20\'19s defense.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CWalker is being slandered and maligned by the \u8216\'20\'18fake news media\u8217\'20\'19 and obviously, the Democrats,\u8221\'20\'1D Trump {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://truthsocial.com/@realDonaldTrump/posts/109111131319108251"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 said}}}\uc2  on his social media platform Truth Social.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CIt\u8217\'20\'19s very important for our county and the great state of Georgia that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://thehill.com/people/herschel-walker/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Herschel Walker}}}\uc2  wins this election,\u8221\'20\'1D he added.\par \par \uc2 Ronna McDaniel\uc2 , chair of the \uc2 Republican National Committee\uc2  (\uc2 RNC\uc2 ), {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/gopchairwoman/status/1577350591411634182?s=46&t=1VKYUTILFCHg3yx-4pundA"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 tweeted}}}\uc2  : \u8220\'20\'1CGeorgia could decide the Senate majority, so desperate Democrats and liberal media have turned to anonymous sources and character assassination.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 McDaniel, who {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/gopchairwoman/status/1540345153222762498"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 responded}}}\uc2  with \u8220\'20\'1CLife wins!\u8221\'20\'1D earlier this year when the supreme court stripped away federal \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  protections, added, \u8220\'20\'1C\uc2 Herschel Walker\uc2  will deliver a safer and more prosperous Georgia, and the \uc2 RNC\uc2  will continue to invest in the Senate race.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 South Carolina\u8217\'20\'19s Republican senator \uc2 Lindsey Graham\uc2  defended Walker on \uc2 Twitter\uc2 , {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/LindseyGrahamSC/status/1577682237696393219?s=20&t=zdKL5uGMFUVBJJas4OJh_A"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 saying,}}}\uc2  \u8220\'20\'1C[Walker] has adamantly denied these allegations and he will be the next senator from Georgia because people are going to vote for what is best for their family.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Graham last month {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2022/sep/13/republican-national-abortion-ban-lindsey-graham"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 proposed}}}\uc2  a nationwide 15-week \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  ban.\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 National Right to Life Committee\uc2 , the country\u8217\'20\'19s oldest and largest national anti-\b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  organization, also released a statement in support of Walker, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.nrlc.org/communications/national-right-to-life-statement-on-herschel-walker/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 calling}}}\uc2  the report a \u8220\'20\'1Cseries of attempted Democratic character assassinations\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CNational Right to Life stands behind its endorsement of \uc2 Herschel Walker\uc2  \u8230\'20\'26 \uc2 Herschel Walker\uc2  wants to protect unborn children while Raphael Warnock wants to see them die through unlimited \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 . The Democratic party knows it cannot win on the issues, so we once again see an attempted character assassination, a tactic that is sadly all too often encouraged by a compliant and willing media.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Susan B Anthony\uc2  Pro-Life America, another anti-\b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  organization, also stood behind Walker amid the reports by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/alexi/status/1577305234472419330?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw%7Ctwcamp%5Etweetembed%7Ctwterm%5E1577305234472419330%7Ctwgr%5Ed38ca42bca9d7b59cab9709d7bc0a8f82c540256%7Ctwcon%5Es1_c10&ref_url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fwhat-we-know-herschel-walker-abortion-scandal-georgia-senate-christian-2022-10"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 saying,}}}\uc2  \u8220\'20\'1C\uc2 Herschel Walker\uc2  has denied these allegations in the strongest possible terms and we stand firmly alongside him.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 One prominent anti-\b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  Republican, the Senate minority leader, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2022/may/11/mitch-mcconnell-senate-republicans-could-not-pass-abortion-ban"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Mitch McConnell}}}\uc2 , has remained unusually quiet since the reports emerged.\par \par \uc2 Earlier this year, McConnell expressed support towards Walker\u8217\'20\'19s candidacy, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.politico.com/news/2021/10/27/herschel-walker-mitch-mcconnells-endorsement-517309"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 saying}}}\uc2  : \u8220\'20\'1CHerschel is the only one who can unite the party, defeat Senator Warnock and help us take back the Senate. I look forward to working with Herschel in Washington to get the job done.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 However, since the reports, McConnell, who has one of the staunchest anti-\b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  voices on Capitol Hill and has previously {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.ontheissues.org/Social/Mitch_McConnell_Abortion.htm"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 voted}}}\uc2  for anti-\b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  bills and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.govtrack.us/congress/votes/103-1993/s11"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 against}}}\uc2  the Family and Medical Leave Act and the Violence Against Women Reauthorization Act, has yet to publicly comment.\par \par \uc2 Document GRDN000020221007eia700232\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw127\pich40\picscaley313\picscalex313\picwgoal610\pichgoal192
