\par\par \uc2 US news\par \b \uc2 Herschel Walker\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s son calls candidate a liar and hypocrite over  \highlight22\uc2 abortion \highlight\uc2  denial\b0\par\par\uc2 Coral Murphy Marcos \par \uc2 757 \uc2 words\par \uc2 4 October 2022\par 15:58 GMT\par \uc2 The Guardian\par \uc2 GRDN\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2022.  The Guardian.  All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Christian Walker says Republican candidate for Senate in Georgia lied about paying for former girlfriend\u8217\'20\'19s termination in 2009\par \par \uc2 The son of Georgia\u8217\'20\'19s Republican US Senate hopeful \uc2 Herschel Walker\uc2  called his father a liar and a hypocrite after a media report alleged that the candidate, who has publicly opposed \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  rights, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2022/oct/04/herschel-walker-anti-abortion-senate-nominee-denies-media-report-he-paid-for-abortion-in-2009"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 paid for an \b  \highlight22abortion\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  for a former girlfriend in 2009.\par \par \uc2 The Daily Beast reported on Monday that Walker, a former pro football player, paid to end the ex-girlfriend\u8217\'20\'19s pregnancy when the couple was dating by depositing a $700 check into her bank account for the procedure. Walker vehemently denies the allegations and has threatened to sue the news outlet for defamation.\par \par \uc2 Walker\u8217\'20\'19s son, Christian Walker, was unimpressed by his father\u8217\'20\'19s denials.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CI don\u8217\'20\'19t care about someone who has a bad past and takes accountability,\u8221\'20\'1D Christian Walker said in a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/ChristianWalk1r/status/1577105221775679488"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 tweet}}}\uc2 . \u8220\'20\'1CBut how DARE YOU LIE and act as though you\u8217\'20\'19re some \u8216\'20\'18moral, Christian, upright man.\u8217\'20\'19\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 I don\u8217\'20\'19t care about someone who has a bad past and takes accountability. But how DARE YOU LIE and act as though you\u8217\'20\'19re some \u8220\'20\'1Cmoral, Christian, upright man.\u8221\'20\'1D You\u8217\'20\'19ve lived a life of DESTROYING other peoples lives. How dare you.\u8212\'20\'14 Christian Walker (@ChristianWalk1r) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/ChristianWalk1r/status/1577105221775679488?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 October 4, 2022}}}\par \par \uc2 Christian Walker also said that family members asked his father not to run for office because everyone knew about at least some of his past.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CHe decided to give us the middle finger and air out all of his dirty laundry in public, while simultaneously lying about it,\u8221\'20\'1D Christian Walker added in a series of tweets.\par \par \uc2 Christian Walker also alleged that the GOP candidate left his family to have sexual encounters with other women and \u8220\'20\'1Cthreatened to kill\u8221\'20\'1D his family, which led them to move more than six times in the course of six months.\par \par \uc2 Herschel Walker\uc2  acknowledged his son\u8217\'20\'19s comments in a tweet by saying: \u8220\'20\'1CI LOVE my son no matter what.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Supporters of \uc2 Herschel Walker\uc2  then tried to make his son out to be a hypocrite by flooding social media with previous videos of the younger Walker hugging his father warmly and speaking about him glowingly.\par \par \uc2 Christian Walker responded to one such video from rightwing political activist Jack Posobiec, saying: \u8220\'20\'1CYea \u8230\'20\'26 well, that was when we were told he was going to \u8216\'20\'18get in front of his past and tell the truth\u8217\'20\'19. You know, before he started lying.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 In a separate series of tweets, the conservative radio commentator Erick Erickson {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://mobile.twitter.com/EWErickson"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 suggested}}}\uc2  he had reason to think Republican political operatives in Georgia were particularly concerned about Christian Walker\u8217\'20\'19s online rant, saying it \u8220\'20\'1Cserved as the admission against interest\u8221\'20\'1D for the candidate and that was \u8220\'20\'1Call down hill from there\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 But US Senate Republicans chairperson Rick Scott issued a statement saying his group remained supportive of Walker, dismissing the Daily Beast report as a Democratic \u8220\'20\'1Csmear\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CRepublicans stand with him, and Georgians will stand with him, too,\u8221\'20\'1D the statement from Scott, a Florida US senator, said about Walker.\par \par \uc2 Walker\u8217\'20\'19s former girlfriend, who was not named, said in the Daily Beast article that Walker encouraged her to have the \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 . She supported her claims with a receipt showing a $575 receipt for the procedure and a get-well card signed by Walker.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThis is a flat-out lie and I deny this in the strongest terms possible,\u8221\'20\'1D Walker wrote in response. Walker has supported a national ban on abortions with no exceptions for cases involving rape, incest or a woman\u8217\'20\'19s health being at risk.\par \par \uc2 His position is especially relevant after the \uc2 US supreme court\uc2  in June eliminated the federal \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  rights that had been established by the Roe v Wade case in 1973.\par \par \uc2 The latest allegation is part of a string of claims about Walker as the midterm elections gear up to take place next month. Earlier this year, another report from the Daily Beast revealed that Walker had three children that he had not previously talked about publicly.\par \par \uc2 Walker later revealed he had four children.\par \par \uc2 Walker is running against \uc2 Raphael Warnock\uc2 , the pastor at Atlanta\u8217\'20\'19s Ebenezer Baptist church. Polling shows Walker is narrowing the gap with Warnock, a Democrat who is seeking re-election.\par \par \uc2 The Democrats currently control the \uc2 US Senate\uc2  and are trying to maintain that during the midterms. The chamber is split 50-50 between the two parties, but Vice-President \uc2 Kamala Harris\uc2  can break ties, and she is a Democrat.\par \par \uc2 Document GRDN000020221004eia400209\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw127\pich40\picscaley313\picscalex313\picwgoal610\pichgoal192
