\par\par \uc2 US news\par \b \uc2 Top Republican urged murder charges for women who defied  \highlight22\uc2 abortion \highlight\uc2  ban\b0\par\par\uc2 Martin Pengelly in New York \par \uc2 551 \uc2 words\par \uc2 28 September 2022\par 19:20 GMT\par \uc2 The Guardian\par \uc2 GRDN\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2022.  The Guardian.  All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Pennsylvania governor hopeful \uc2 Doug Mastriano\uc2  made comments in 2019 while discussing \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  bill he proposed as state senator\par \par \uc2 Asked in 2019 if he was saying women should be charged with murder for violating an \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  ban he proposed, \uc2 Doug Mastriano\uc2 , now the Republican nominee for governor of Pennsylvania, said: \u8220\'20\'1CYes, I am.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Mastriano was {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.witf.org/2019/11/14/heart-beat-bill-under/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 talking to WITF}}}\uc2 , a radio station, about a bill he sponsored as a state senator.\par \par \uc2 The bill would have barred most abortions when cardiac activity could be detected, which is usually about six weeks into pregnancy, before many women know they are pregnant.\par \par \uc2 Mastriano was asked: \u8220\'20\'1CYou can give me a yes or no on this. Would that woman who decided to have an \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  which would be considered an illegal \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  be charged with murder?\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Mastriano said: \u8220\'20\'1COK, let\u8217\'20\'19s go back to the basic question there. Is [a fetus] a human being? Is that a little boy or girl? If it is, it deserves equal protection under the law.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 He was asked: \u8220\'20\'1CSo you\u8217\'20\'19re saying yes?\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Mastriano {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/SawyerHackett/status/1574820825835999244"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 said}}}\uc2  : \u8220\'20\'1CYes, I am. If it\u8217\'20\'19s a human being, if it\u8217\'20\'19s an American citizen there, a little baby, I don\u8217\'20\'19t care what nationality it is, it deserves equal rights before the law.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 NBC News reported the remark on Tuesday. Mastriano did not immediately comment.\par \par \uc2 Wow. NBC obtained a 2019 interview with Republican nominee for Pennsylvania governor \uc2 Doug Mastriano\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Q: Are you saying that a woman who decided to have an \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  [under your proposed bill] should be charged with murder?\par \par \uc2 A: \u8220\'20\'1CYes, I am.\u8221\'20\'1D {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/ffuPrzoWiR"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://t.co/ffuPrzoWiR}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/78HEuxX8cJ"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pic.twitter.com/78HEuxX8cJ}}}\uc2  \u8212\'20\'14 Sawyer Hackett (@SawyerHackett) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/SawyerHackett/status/1574820825835999244?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 September 27, 2022}}}\par \par \uc2 On Monday, he {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/DBrodyReports/status/1574492063856410625"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 told}}}\uc2  the conservative Real America\u8217\'20\'19s Voice network: \u8220\'20\'1CMy views are kind of irrelevant because I cannot rule by fiat or edict or executive order on the issue of life.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CIt\u8217\'20\'19s up to the people of Pennsylvania. So if Pennsylvanians want exceptions, if they want to limit the number of weeks, it\u8217\'20\'19s going to have to come from your legislative body and then to my desk.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Mastriano has been dogged by controversy, including over his links to the January 6 insurrection.\par \par \uc2 According to the polling website {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://projects.fivethirtyeight.com/polls/governor/2022/pennsylvania/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 fivethirtyeight.com}}}\uc2 , the Republican trails \uc2 Josh Shapiro\uc2 , his Democratic opponent for the governor\u8217\'20\'19s mansion, by more than 10 points.\par \par \uc2 In June, the \uc2 US supreme court{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2022/jun/24/roe-v-wade-overturned-abortion-summary-supreme-court"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 overturned Roe v Wade}}}\uc2 , the landmark 1973 ruling which guaranteed the right to \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Since then, Democrats have enjoyed a number of striking electoral successes fueled by the issue of \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  rights, including in Republican areas {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2022/aug/12/how-abortion-rights-won-kansas-strategies"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 such as Kansas}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Amid reports of {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2022/sep/18/roe-v-wade-abortion-us-politics-november-midterms"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 rising voter registration}}}\uc2  among women, Democrats are seeking to make \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  rights central to midterm elections in November, when they will seek to retain control of Congress.\par \par \uc2 Republicans including Mastriano have attempted to downplay the issue and focus on economic messaging instead.\par \par \uc2 On Tuesday, Shapiro seized on Mastriano\u8217\'20\'19s 2019 remarks.\par \par \uc2 The Democrat {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/JoshShapiroPA/status/1574833217517097013"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 tweeted}}}\uc2  : \u8220\'20\'1CWe knew \uc2 Doug Mastriano\uc2  would ban \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  in Pennsylvania with no exceptions \u8211\'20\'13 even for rape, incest, or life of the mother. We knew he\u8217\'20\'19d throw doctors in jail for performing them.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CNow, we know he\u8217\'20\'19d charge women who receive an \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  with murder.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Document GRDN000020220928ei9s000rv\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw127\pich40\picscaley313\picscalex313\picwgoal610\pichgoal192
